# Project records

Where {{PROJECT}}'s decisions, progress and open problems live. Humans and coding agents both keep these current.

| File | What it holds | Update when |
|---|---|---|
| [STATUS.md](STATUS.md) | Current milestone, what's in flight, blockers, open questions, next steps | Something starts, finishes, gets blocked or unblocked |
| [log.md](log.md) | Dated progress log, newest first | End of every working session |
| [decisions/](decisions/) | One record per significant decision (ADR): context, choice, alternatives rejected, consequences | A decision is made or reversed |
| [../specs/](../specs/README.md) | Build plan, gates, open technical decisions, one executable spec folder per piece of work, task ledger | Before building each spec, and as tasks complete |
